      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You can make a script to delete your `%LocalAppData%Low\\VRChat\\VRChat\\LocalPlayerModerations\\[userid]-show-hide-user.vrcset` or replace every line with `005` suffixed at the end in it.\n\nNo new feature is needed in VRChat.",
